{"title": "Kerala Government to Investigate Allegations Over Public Service Commission Appointments", "summary": "The Kerala government has announced an investigation into allegations regarding the appointments made by the state's Public Service Commission (PSC). The move comes after internal inquiries sparked concerns about a lack of transparency and fairness in the process. The investigation aims to address these concerns and ensure that the PSC appointments are conducted in a fair and transparent manner.", "summary_points": ["The Kerala government has announced an investigation into allegations regarding the appointments made by the state's Public Service Commission (PSC).", "The move comes after internal inquiries sparked concerns about a lack of transparency and fairness in the process.", "The investigation aims to address these concerns and ensure that the PSC appointments are conducted in a fair and transparent manner.", "The allegations center around the appointment process, with some critics arguing that it was marred by irregularities and favoritism.", "The government's decision to investigate is seen as an effort to restore trust in the PSC and its appointment process."], "title_hi": "केरल सरकार पब्लिक सर्विस कमीशन नियुक्तियों पर जांच करेगी", "summary_hi": "केरल सरकार ने पब्लिक सर्विस कमीशन (पीएससी) नियुक्तियों पर जांच करने का फैसला किया है। यह निर्णय अंतर्निहित जांचों से उत्पन्न चिंताओं को दूर करने और प्रक्रिया में ईमानदारी और स्पष्टता की गारंटी देने के लिए किया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["केरल सरकार ने पब्लिक सर्विस कमीशन (पीएससी) नियुक्तियों पर जांच करने का फैसला किया है।", "यह निर्णय अंतर्निहित जांचों से उत्पन्न चिंताओं को दूर करने और प्रक्रिया में ईमानदारी और स्पष्टता की गारंटी देने के लिए किया गया है।", "अलlegations center around the appointment process, with some critics arguing that it was marred by irregularities and favoritism.", "The government's decision to investigate is seen as an effort to restore trust in the PSC and its appointment process."], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage focuses on the government's announcement of an investigation, noting its significance in restoring trust in the PSC and its appointment process. However, some outlets mention that the investigation may not fully address concerns about irregularities and favoritism."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रीय समाचार संगठन प्रशासन द्वारा जांच की घोषणा पर ध्यान केंद्रित करते हैं, नोटिस करते हैं कि इसकी महत्ता पीएससी और नियुक्तियों में विश्वास को फिर से बनाए रखने में। हालांकि, कुछ समाचार संगठन अनियमितताओं और विशेषाधिकार के बारे में चिंताओं को पूरी तरह से संबोधित नहीं करते हैं।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://www.jagranimages.com/images/2026/07/06/article/image/Ramlala-1783283662458_m.webp", "sources": [{"source": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Kerala govt to probe allegations regarding PSC appointments: Minister Janeesh"}, {"source": "Aaj Tak", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.aajtak.in/short-videos/video/ram-mandir-trust-meeting-champat-rai-anil-mishra-resignation-donation-case-sit-report-ayodhya-mmta-2593992-2026-07-04", "headline": "अयोध्या राम मंदिर ट्रस्ट की महाबैठक: चंपत राय का बड़ा फैसला!"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Planning Board exam row: Kerala PSC's internal inquiry sparks allegations of a shoddy probe"}, {"source": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Kerala health minister orders probe into unused medical equipment purchases"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Badrinath donation row: Temple committee forms panel to probe allegations of irregularities"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/article